@ 0 11 0 1ef2fe77896e5abc1c05cbee72b447f3
+           column  分支
+           column  代码
+           column  消息
+           column  备注
+           row  `Parse`  1  _the message could not be parsed as JSON_  线上代码 −32700
+           row  `InvalidRequest`  2  _the message was not a valid JSON-RPC request_  线上代码 −32600
+           row  `MethodNotFound`  3  _the method name was not recognised_  线上代码 −32601
+           row  `InvalidParams`  4  _the parameters were not valid for the requested method_  线上代码 −32602
+           row  `Internal`  5  _an internal error occurred_  线上代码 −32603
+           row  `AuthRequired`  6  _the agent requires authentication_  线上代码 −32000
+           row  `Incompatible`  7  _the agent does not support the protocol version this client implements_  无线上代码

